{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id16452162"}, "name":{"label":"Yannick_"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-06-02T23:12:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1388149603"}, "title":{"label":"High Quality Sounds, App could be improved"}, "content":{"label":"First of all the most important thing: The sounds are perfect. Good quality, appropriate variety and no discernible beginning/end of the loops.\n\nWhat could be improved: The app could need some polish. The volume sliders tend to have problems (e.g. two of them overlap). What annoys me most is that the app does not react to the play/pause signal from the earphone remote and if the earphones are unplugged, the playback does not pause but continues over the phone's speakers, which is very annoying. If that would be fixed, the app would be perfect.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
